---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { MODALITY_CARDS } from '../data/content';
---

<section class="section section--dark on-dark" id="modalidades" aria-labelledby="mod-title">
  <div class="mod-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><b>02</b> Modalidades</p>
        <h2 id="mod-title">Três formas de ter o seu servidor dedicado</h2>
      </div>
      <p>O mesmo dimensionamento pode virar compra, locação ou um servidor em data center. A diferença está em quem é dono do equipamento, onde ele fica e como você paga.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="mod-grid">
      {
        MODALITY_CARDS.map((m, i) => (
          <li class="mod-card" data-reveal style={`--reveal-i:${i}`}>
            <div class="mod-top">
              <span class="mod-icon">
                <Icon name={m.icon} size={22} />
              </span>
              <span class="mod-kicker">{m.kicker}</span>
            </div>
            <h3>{m.title}</h3>
            <p class="mod-text">{m.text}</p>
            <ul class="mod-points">
              {m.points.map((p) => (
                <li>
                  <Icon name="check" size={16} strokeWidth={2.25} />
                  {p}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            {m.link && (
              <a class="mod-more" href={m.link.href}>
                {m.link.label} <Icon name="arrow-right" size={15} />
              </a>
            )}
            <div class="mod-actions">
              <a class="btn btn--outline-dark" href="#configurar" data-sim-preset={`modality:${m.modality}`} data-track="cta_click" data-track-location={`modalidade-${m.modality}`}>
                {m.cta}
                <Icon name="arrow-right" class="btn-arrow" />
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <p class="mod-note">
      <Icon name="scale" size={18} />
      <span>Na dúvida entre as três? No simulador, marque <strong>"Ainda não sei, quero comparar"</strong> e receba as opções lado a lado na proposta.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section--dark {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mod-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20% -10% auto auto;
    width: 60%;
    height: 80%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgb(61 58 134 / 0.5), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .mod-grid {
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .mod-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .mod-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1vw, 2.25rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line-dark);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.015));
  }

  .mod-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .mod-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgb(249 131 5 / 0.12);
    color: var(--c-orange);
  }

  .mod-kicker {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: var(--t-label);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c-on-dark-3);
  }

  .mod-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 1.1rem + 0.6vw, 1.6rem);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .mod-text {
    color: var(--c-on-dark-2);
  }

  .mod-points {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-line-dark);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .mod-points li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .mod-points :global(svg) {
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--c-success-on-dark);
  }

  .mod-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .mod-more {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    width: fit-content;
    color: var(--c-orange);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .mod-more:hover {
    color: var(--c-on-dark);
  }

  .mod-note {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--c-on-dark-2);
  }

  .mod-note :global(svg) {
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--c-orange);
  }

  .mod-note strong {
    color: var(--c-on-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
